&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt’s Courier Employment team is building something that doesn’t really exist yet — a cross-country infrastructure for employed courier operations across multiple geographies. We sit at the intersection of operations, people, legal, and compliance, and we’re doing it largely from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The function currently spans three countries (Finland, Germany, Croatia), each at a different stage of maturity and with different legal frameworks. Courier employment is managed in all these countries by a functional team handling strategy, structure and resources, and country-level teams focused on execution and operational excellence from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate in a fast-moving environment with a high degree of uncertainty — regulatory, operational, and structural. If you’re energised by the possibilities and want to be the person who builds the playbook, this might be the right role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Croatia doesn&#39;t have an independent Courier HR operating model yet. It has support from the general employee HR team, great people working hard, manual workarounds, and a scale-up landing in the next few months that the current setup wasn&#39;t built to absorb. This role exists to establish Courier HR expertise within the function and build the processes needed while running the team&#39;s day-to-day HR operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Courier HR Senior Specialist in Croatia, you&#39;ll own the full employee lifecycle for a fast-growing courier workforce: onboarding, contracts, documentation, leave, and the HR side of a workforce that includes couriers relocating from abroad. This includes tracking of work permits and other integration and compliance related matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be supported by the function’s core team and leadership and work closely with your Courier HR Lead, the Workforce Ops team, Legal, and the sourcing agencies bringing couriers in. You&#39;ll be the most senior Courier HR operator on the ground in Croatia day-to-day — which means you&#39;ll be trusted to make independent decisions and participate actively in building foundations and standards that will apply across all markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee lifecycle execution at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own onboarding, contracts, documentation, and leave administration for Croatia&#39;s employed couriers, including the operational HR side of relocating couriers from abroad (documentation, work permit tracking, compliance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delegating and syncing with a Tier 1 HR team that handles standard inbound tickets and manual entry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain accurate employee records across HR systems as the courier base scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle the volume and pace of onboarding waves without letting quality or compliance slip.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the judgment calls on ambiguous or non-standard cases that come up, escalating appropriately to your Courier HR Lead or Legal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and SOP creation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create SOPs, checklists, and documentation in collaboration with the functional Process &amp;amp; Systems Senior Specialist based on cross-market standards and calibrated to local requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where the current setup will break under the incoming scale-up, then plan and build for it before it breaks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Process &amp;amp; Systems Senior Specialist on anything that should become a cross-country standard rather than a local fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the day-to-day HR point of contact for the sourcing agencies bringing couriers into Croatia, ensuring HR-side obligations (documentation, onboarding timing, permits) are met on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Workforce Ops to keep HR and operational onboarding in sync as waves of new couriers arrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag structural risks early and initiate appropriate action in collaboration with your Lead and functional colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s no single background that defines this role — but the people who do well here tend to combine sharp analytical thinking with genuine operational curiosity. Some things that matter:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in HR operations, people operations, or workforce administration — ideally somewhere that involved real scale, strict deadlines, or a workforce with cross-border or compliance complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with foreign worker documentation, work permits, residence permits, or employment compliance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine ability to operate without a finished playbook. If &quot;there&#39;s no process for this yet&quot; makes you anxious rather than interested, this isn&#39;t the right role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail that holds up under volume and pressure — the documentation has legal weight, and the standard shouldn’t drop with rapidly increasing volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgment about what to decide yourself and what to escalate. This role only works if you can be trusted with ambiguity — and trusted to know your own limits within it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Croatian (C1-C2) and professional level in English (B2-C2) are a requirement. Given the courier population arriving from abroad, comfort working through language and documentation barriers is a real asset — additional languages (Spanish, for instance) are a plus but not requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a hybrid model from our Zagreb office (4 office days, Wednesday optional work-from-home day).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most HR operations roles ask you to run a process well. This one asks you to build the process while running it, for a workforce that&#39;s about to grow faster than the current setup was designed for, in a market where the team is small and knowledge is yet to be mapped to documentation. You will work with a team of experts in multiple countries, giving you a unique chance to influence our strategies, standards and ways of working while constantly learning something new.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If it sounds like the kind of challenge you would enjoy solving, and if you are inspired by the potential of directly impacting the experience of hard working individuals establishing themselves in a new country, this will be a great opportunity for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that this is a fixed-term contract until Dec 31st 2026, with a possibility to extend to a permanent contract. We’re expecting you to be able to start working with us during August-early September.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sport benefit (PassSport)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tax-free commuter benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A monthly lunch benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt Credits Cashback program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the Employee Assistance Program (free, confidential mental health support) and the Cuckoo wellness app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your application and resume in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hiring process includes conversations with the talent acquisition partner, hiring managers and a practical assignment with a final cross-functional discussion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of a motivated team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Upsun (formerly Platform.sh)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun is the cloud application platform humans and robots love. It is built for today’s hybrid teams, where AI agents write and test code and humans focus on solving the problems that really matter. Developers, DevOps engineers, and platform teams use Upsun to build, ship, and scale confidently without wrestling with backend infrastructure. We give you your time back. You get:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Predictable performance, even at scale &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Secure, compliant environments by default&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Real-time observability and profiling built in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cloning, configuration, and provisioning in seconds&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AI-ready features that plug directly into your stack &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The name says it all. &quot;Up&quot; means uptime, reliability, and acceleration. &quot;Sun&quot; reflects our follow-the-sun-support, a 24x7, globally distributed support team keeping the lights on while you rest. Our core belief is that software should power brighter solutions and greater innovation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsunners are a remote, global workforce, and we thrive in a multicultural team. We are committed to open source and an open, welcoming environment. Our team spans the globe and the experience spectrum. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s our commonality, our cultural fabric? A curious spirit and a thirst for knowledge; an eagerness for innovative ideas and cultures. We believe we can build anything together in an environment that frees you to do your best work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌿 We make a positive impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;✨ We aim for the stars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💚 We care for each other.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Impact of a Senior Analytics Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Analytics Engineer, you will join our Data Science and Engineering team at Upsun to help our company make smarter choices. You will do this by helping us better understand our customers and internal operations. You will work with large amounts of platform and business data to create clear insights that improve our product and decisions. In this role, you will use &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;DBT&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Hex&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Metabase&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt; data tools. You will work on important projects like building new data models with Salesforce and financial data, or working with AI tools and cloud cost modeling (FinOps).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Modeling and Architecture:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You will design and build models that turn raw data into useful metrics and data products, using DBT and medallion architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Metric Design &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You will define what success looks like for our products, setting up and tracking key business metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work with technical and non-technical teams to collect requirements, share methods, and teach best practices for using data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You will lead data modeling projects, choosing the right tools and planning how to complete the work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Scalable Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work efficiently with data of all sizes, including petabyte-scale datasets, to help everyone make data-based decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; You will guide partner teams by creating and explaining analytical metrics, helping them understand how data impacts different parts of the product and business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational Efficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; You will improve our team&#39;s processes and code by creating well-documented solutions that can be used again in the future&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evolving Modern Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; You will use modern tools (GCP BigQuery, AWS S3, Fivetran, Hightouch, and AI tools like Claude Code) and help us improve our data architecture as it grows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Global Remote Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work with a worldwide, remote team that values learning, open source software, and new ideas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;DBT&lt;/strong&gt; in real production settings, along with good habits in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Solid experience building data models for large datasets (up to petabytes) in cloud platforms like &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity and Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; A passion for testing new tools, learning new technologies, and finding simple ways to solve complex problems. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Tradeoffs: &lt;/strong&gt;The ability to choose the best solution among different technical options, communicate clearly, and work well asynchronously. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience creating solutions and explaining them clearly to different types of audiences. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfort working in a remote team, managing your time well, and working across multiple teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prior experience working with FinOps principles or FOCUS data models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience or interest in building AI data agents and modern AI-assisted data workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, remote work isn&#39;t just a trend - it&#39;s our foundation. The freedom of remote work with the support of a diverse, global team has been our successful model for over a decade. Our culture celebrates flexibility and collaboration, and while we have team members in over 30 countries around the globe, we are currently focused on hiring for this role in&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;France, Germany, Spain, and the United Kingdom&lt;/strong&gt;. Although we’re unable to provide visa sponsorship at this time, we welcome applications from all qualified candidates who are legally authorized to work in these countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We know that a great hire won’t meet every requirement that we’ve outlined. If you can see yourself elevating the team, we want to hear your story. Few of us would be here had we not taken a chance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You can expect &lt;strong&gt;4&lt;/strong&gt; interviews on Google Meet to follow the order below. Should you successfully move through the entire process you will have the opportunity to meet with a variety of Upsunners. Our goal is to ensure you can make the most informed decision on whether this role, and our culture aligns with what you’re looking for in your future working environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Hiring Manager (Director, Data Engineering and Data Science)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Team (ICs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
